:js


print of ...
123
//│ > 123

print of...
123
//│ > 123

print of
  123
//│ > 123


// * Interesting quirk:

print of ...
[1, 2]
//│ > [1, 2]

print of ...
  [1, 2]
//│ > 1 2


if true do...

if true do...
print(1)
//│ > 1


